# Network Topology

## IP plan

| Host             | IP             | Role                       | Notes                          |
|------------------|----------------|----------------------------|--------------------------------|
| labnet gateway   | 192.168.64.1   | UTM host-only gateway      | UTM-internal, not a VM         |
| SOC-SIEM         | 192.168.64.9   | Wazuh indexer/server/UI    | 1514/udp in, 9200/tcp, 443/tcp |
| Linux Endpoint   | 192.168.64.14  | Target + agent             | 22/tcp, 80/tcp                 |
| Attacker         | 192.168.64.12  | Offensive tooling          | outbound only                  |
| Windows Endpoint | 192.168.64.16  | Target + agent + Sysmon    | 445/tcp, 3389/tcp optional     |

## Ports of interest

- **1514/udp** — Wazuh agent → server (event traffic).
- **1515/tcp** — Wazuh agent enrollment.
- **55000/tcp** — Wazuh server → indexer (internal).
- **9200/tcp** — Wazuh indexer REST.
- **443/tcp** — Wazuh dashboard.

## Traffic matrix

```
Source              Destination         Protocol   Purpose
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Linux Endpoint      SOC-SIEM            1514/udp   agent events
Windows Endpoint    SOC-SIEM            1514/udp   agent + Sysmon events
Attacker            Linux Endpoint      any        recon + exploitation
Attacker            Windows Endpoint    any        recon + exploitation
SOC-SIEM            (host browser)      443/tcp    analyst UI
```

